<li><a href="https://osint.bambenekconsulting.com/feeds/c2-dommasterlist-high.txt">Domains from High-Confidence DGA-based C&amp;C Domains Actively Resolving</a> - osint.bambenekconsulting.com - feed format: csv</li>
<li><a href="https://cdn.ellio.tech/community-feed">ELLIO: IP Feed (Community version)</a> - ellio.tech - feed format: freetext</li>
